      "width": 259.1375,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "preflight — the reset\nthe fonts, and --font-sans / --font-mono\n@property registrations\nthe theme variables on :root\n\nAll of it inherits into every container, so\nno container ships a reset or a variable of\nits own.",
      "originalText": "preflight — the reset\nthe fonts, and --font-sans / --font-mono\n@property registrations\nthe theme variables on :root\n\nAll of it inherits into every container, so\nno container ships a reset or a variable of\nits own.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
