      "updated": 1735689600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "aI",
      "id": "styling-scope-text-19",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 478,
      "width": 393.25,
      "height": 137.5,
      "text": "<body>\n  ... the shell chrome ...\n  <div data-mfe-scope=\"operations\" data-mfe-kind=\"app\"\n       data-mfe-mount=\"operations#1\"\n       style=\"display: contents\">               the scope root\n    <StyleRoot>   the container’s own ThemeRoot\n      ... the App ...\n  <div data-mfe-scope=\"operations\" data-mfe-mount=\"operations#1\"\n       data-mfe-overlay-root data-tecton-root>   the overlay root\n    ... every dialog, popover, tooltip and menu ...",
      "originalText": "<body>\n  ... the shell chrome ...\n  <div data-mfe-scope=\"operations\" data-mfe-kind=\"app\"\n       data-mfe-mount=\"operations#1\"\n       style=\"display: contents\">               the scope root\n    <StyleRoot>   the container’s own ThemeRoot\n      ... the App ...\n  <div data-mfe-scope=\"operations\" data-mfe-mount=\"operations#1\"\n       data-mfe-overlay-root data-tecton-root>   the overlay root\n    ... every dialog, popover, tooltip and menu ...",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 803714679,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1332493149,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1735689600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "aJ",
      "id": "styling-scope-text-20",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 662,
      "width": 539.3499999999999,
      "height": 46.875,
      "text": "The scope root is display: contents, so it anchors a selector without becoming a box in\nthe layout. The overlay root sits at body level and carries the same attribute, which is\nwhat keeps an overlay inside the container’s scope instead of on a bare document body.",
      "originalText": "The scope root is display: contents, so it anchors a selector without becoming a box in\nthe layout. The overlay root sits at body level and carries the same attribute, which is\nwhat keeps an overlay inside the container’s scope instead of on a bare document body.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
