      "id": "styling-scope-text-24",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1054,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 274.43750000000006,
      "height": 187.5,
      "text": "@scope is the narrowest-supported feature\nthe framework requires, and it is emitted\nwith no fallback.\n\nBelow Chrome 118, Firefox 146 or iOS\nSafari 17.4 the rule does not apply, and\nthe last stylesheet on the page wins,\nunscoped.\n\nEach container’s @keyframes names carry its\nids as a suffix, because such names are\npage-wide whatever scopes the rules.",
      "originalText": "@scope is the narrowest-supported feature\nthe framework requires, and it is emitted\nwith no fallback.\n\nBelow Chrome 118, Firefox 146 or iOS\nSafari 17.4 the rule does not apply, and\nthe last stylesheet on the page wins,\nunscoped.\n\nEach container’s @keyframes names carry its\nids as a suffix, because such names are\npage-wide whatever scopes the rules.",
